              "value": "Feed On Fear"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate)\n\nRequirements: An enemy is under a fear effect or dying within 15 feet of the will-o'-wisp\n\nThe will-o'-wisp feeds on the creature's terror. They regains 4d8 Hit Points, and if they've Gone Dark, their glow reignites. A will-o'-wisp can take this action only once per round."
