            "action_name": {
              "value": "Go Dark"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate)\n\nThe gloaming will-o'-wisp extinguishes their hypnotic glow, becoming invisible.\n\nThey can end this effect with another use of this action.\n\nIf they use their shock attack while invisible, the arc of electricity lets any observer determine their location, making the will-o'-wisp only hidden to observers until they move."
